    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Resume.Hint">With "Keep what was downloaded", finished files are not fetched twice: close the program mid-queue and the apps already downloaded are reused. Size and licence are verified first, so an incomplete file is still downloaded again.</sys:String>
