    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi">Wi-Fi connection</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi.Toggle">Look for devices over Wi-Fi</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi.Hint">Lets you use a device without a cable. Connect the device by cable once when enabling this — that is the only way to allow the iPhone to respond over the network. After that the device must be on the same network and unlocked. Wi-Fi is markedly slower, so a cable remains more reliable for installing apps and browsing photos.</sys:String>
