    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi.NoDevices">No cabled device found. Connect the iPhone by cable and turn this on again, otherwise the device will not respond over the network.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi.Failed">Could not prepare the device for Wi-Fi. Check that it is unlocked and that you tapped Trust. See the log for details.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Settings.Wifi.NoBonjour">The Apple Bonjour service is missing or disabled. Devices cannot be found over the network without it — Bonjour is what reports which iPhones are responding. Reinstall iTunes from apple.com; its installer includes Bonjour.</sys:String>
